    "description": "<p>The PDX BIDS Sprint was the first in a series of three coding sprint events meant to facilitate focused work for core BIDS and OpenNeuro maintainers in order to develop a new BIDS validator based on a BIDS schema. Also known in places as the Schema and Validator Sprint, this first one was held in Portland, Oregon, April 11-15, 2022.&nbsp;This report summariszes the work done that week including, but not limited to GitHub Pull Requests, whiteboard captures, and other notes.</p>"
  },
